# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore
#
# Sections 1-3: ordinary hygiene (caches, virtual environments, logs, editors).
# Section 4:    the proprietary Microsoft binaries that were analysed. They are
#               never to be committed.
# Section 5:    working files that were *derived from* the Microsoft binaries
#               (decompiled code, extracted strings and resources, screenshots
#               of the original app). They are ignored by default, pending the
#               rights review. Delete a line here only after deciding that the
#               corresponding file can be published.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env

# 2. Logs, temporary and OS/editor files
*.log
nohup.out
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*~
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/

# 3. Claude Code local settings (machine-specific)
.claude/settings.local.json

# 4. Proprietary Microsoft binaries (the analysed APPX package contents). Never publish.
binarios/
binarios-ptbr/

# 5. Working files derived from the Microsoft binaries. Ignored pending rights review.
#    (own scripts, notes, logs, UIA box measurements and reimplementation screenshots stay tracked)

# 5a. Decompiled pseudocode (Ghidra output for CalcViewModel.dll functions)
trabalho/pseudocodigo/
trabalho/fase3c/cis-chamadores-to_wstring.txt
trabalho/fase3c/l11-tabela-salto.txt

# 5b. Raw strings extracted from the DLLs.
trabalho/strings/

# 5c. RTTI, WinRT metadata and global-string dumps of the DLLs and .winmd files
trabalho/rtti/
trabalho/winmd/
trabalho/hstring-globais.json
trabalho/cengine-ids.json
trabalho/fase1-pe.json
trabalho/fase1-winmd-tipos.json

# 5d. resources.pri dumps: compiled XAML (XBF) copied byte for byte, its disassembly and every localized UI string
trabalho/pri/xbf/
trabalho/pri/xbf-nos/
trabalho/pri/xbf-strings/
trabalho/pri/recursos.json
trabalho/pri/Resources.tsv
trabalho/pri/CEngineStrings.tsv
trabalho/pri/blobs.json
trabalho/pri/xbf-resumo.json
trabalho/pri/xbf-botoes.tsv
trabalho/ptbr/recursos.json
trabalho/ptbr/Resources.tsv
trabalho/ptbr/CEngineStrings.tsv
trabalho/ptbr/blobs.json
trabalho/ptbr/validacao-pri.json

# 5e. REA evidence bundles and the Ghidra snapshot (embed pseudocode and local machine paths)
trabalho/fase*-evidencias.json
trabalho/ghidra/

# 5f. XBF extractor and its type table. The node-stream disassembly in xbf_dump.py is ported from
#     chausner/XbfTools (Apache-2.0) and xbf_framework_ids.json is converted from that project's tables
#     (which it attributes to the Windows SDK). Kept out rather than published without the Apache-2.0 notices.
trabalho/scripts/dados/
trabalho/scripts/xbf_dump.py

# 5g. Screenshots and video frames of the original Microsoft Calculator
#     (*.uia.tsv measurement files in the same folders stay tracked; the GUI tests read them)
trabalho/automacao/capturas/
trabalho/visual/ref/**/*.png
trabalho/visual/ref-claro/**/*.png
trabalho/visual/ref-cientifico/**/*.png
trabalho/visual/ref-cientifico-claro/**/*.png
trabalho/visual/comparacoes*/*.png
trabalho/visual/anim/

# 6. Scratch outputs that embed a personal path (\\wsl.localhost\<distro>\home\<user>\...) and byte-identical
#    duplicates of other logs. Ignored for privacy and tidiness; nothing in the reports depends on them.
trabalho/automacao/saida-casos3c.txt
trabalho/automacao/saida-casos3d.txt
trabalho/diferencial/saida-ps1.txt
trabalho/diferencial/saida-ps1-p2.txt
trabalho/diferencial/saida-ps1-dif2.txt
trabalho/automacao/log-execucao-3b.txt
trabalho/automacao/log-execucao-3d.txt

# 7. Run logs and regression screenshots that no report cites. The results they produced are already in
#    relatorio/ (resultados-reais-*.jsonl) and trabalho/visual/comparacoes-regressao/resumo.txt.
trabalho/automacao/log-execucao-3b-execucao2.txt
trabalho/automacao/log-execucao-3d-execucao2.txt
trabalho/automacao/log-execucao-diferencial.txt
trabalho/automacao/log-resultados-reais-diferencial-p2.txt
trabalho/automacao/log-resultados-reais-diferencial2.txt
trabalho/visual/reimpl-regressao/

# 8. Graphical interface that reproduces the original application's visual design, its screenshots
#    and the visual-calibration material (measurements and captures). Kept out of the public repository.
reimpl/calculadora/gui/
reimpl/tests/test_gui.py
reimpl/tests/test_gui_cientifico.py
reimpl/ferramentas/abrir_gui.sh
docs/screenshots/
trabalho/visual/

# 9. PRI parser written with chausner/PriTools (Apache-2.0) as a reference. Kept out until its
#    attribution is settled.
trabalho/scripts/pri_dump.py
